#: ../../../reference/interfaces/optical-drive-interface.md:2
msgid "optical-drive interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/optical-drive-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"`optical-drive` allows read/write access to optical drives, suitable for CD/"
"DVD/Blu-Ray playback and burning. This interface is not currently available "
"to use on Ubuntu Core, only classic systems can use this interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/optical-drive-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"**Auto-Connect**: by default, yes; when `write: true`, no **Attributes**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/optical-drive-interface.md:8
msgid "`write`: `true|false`, defaults to `false`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/optical-drive-interface.md:10
msgid "`write` available in snap versions _2.33+_."
msgstr ""
